# WINDSURF / CASCADE AGENT RULES — TechMindDev

## Architecture & Code Limits
- Clean Architecture: Domain layer has ZERO external dependencies.
- Max 200 lines per file. Max 40 lines per function. Single Responsibility.
- Interfaces: Inject all repositories, payment gateways and brokers through interfaces.

## Database & ORM
- Use UUIDv7 / ULID for all primary keys.
- Prevent N+1 queries by using Eager Loading with JOIN or IN clauses.
- Use connection pooler in serverless environments.

## Versioning & Commits
- Follow SemVer: MAJOR (breaking), MINOR (feature), PATCH (fix).
- Commit format: Conventional Commits (`feat:`, `fix:`, `feat!:`).

## Mobile & Flutter Cache
- `pubspec.yaml`: `version: MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH+BUILD_NUMBER`.
- Display version dynamically with PackageInfo.
- Reset cache with `flutter clean` when troubleshooting.

## Error Handling & Types
- Strict types only (no `any`).
- Throw typed domain exceptions. Never swallow errors in empty catch blocks.
- Validate inputs with Zod schemas.
